# Appendix — Quick Reference Rate Card

This appendix provides a simplified reference of Klaud’s partner net pricing. It is intended for quick internal review, opportunity estimation, and proposal planning.

All prices are in **USD** and are intended for **qualified partners only**. This rate card is not intended to be shared directly with end customers.

Final pricing is subject to technical validation, customer environment complexity, delivery assumptions, resource availability, and agreed scope.

---

## 17.1 On-Demand Hourly Services

| Service Type                               |                 Partner Net Rate |
| ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------: |
| Standard Senior VMware Consulting          |                    **$165/hour** |
| Principal Architect / Advanced Specialist  |                    **$195/hour** |
| Emergency, After-Hours, or Weekend Support |                    **$260/hour** |
| Onsite Consulting Day Rate                 | **$1,850/day + travel expenses** |

**Minimum engagement:** 10 hours
**Billing increment:** 4-hour blocks after minimum engagement
**Delivery model:** Remote by default
**Availability:** Best effort, subject to resource availability

