## 17.7 Expert Bank Consumption Rules

| Item                         | Rule                                                  |
| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Standard delivery            | Business hours, remote delivery                       |
| After-hours support          | Consumes hours at 1.5x                                |
| Weekend or emergency support | Consumes hours at 2x                                  |
| Onsite work                  | Minimum 10 hours per onsite day, plus travel expenses |
| Unused hours                 | Expire at the end of the validity period              |
| Rollover                     | Up to 15% may roll over if renewed before expiry      |
| Priority access              | Included for Expert Bank 320 and Expert Bank 480      |

