## 17.9 Recommended Use by Scenario

| Scenario                                                                         | Recommended Model                                |
| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Small task, technical question, or short advisory request                        | On-Demand Hourly Services                        |
| New partner wants to test Klaud’s expertise                                      | On-Demand Hourly Services                        |
| Partner needs help qualifying an opportunity                                     | On-Demand Hourly Services or Expert Bank         |
| Partner needs predictable pricing for a customer proposal                        | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                       |
| Customer requires VCF design and deployment                                      | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                       |
| Customer requires upgrade, migration, or re-platforming                          | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                       |
| Customer requires advanced services such as VKS, NSX Federation, vDefend, or SRM | Fixed-Price Add-On                               |
| Partner has recurring VMware opportunities                                       | Partner Expert Capacity Plan                     |
| Partner needs urgent project rescue or escalation                                | Hourly Services or Rescue / Stabilization Sprint |
| Partner wants ongoing access to senior VMware expertise                          | Partner Expert Capacity Plan                     |

